{"lines":[{"w":0.31021194458007817,"h":0.016037735849056656,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","c":1,"x":0.10019267886290241,"y":0.049371069372481036},{"y":0.09738372050381372,"w":0.35067436218261716,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 2","c":1,"x":0.098265901675944553,"h":0.021802326418318918},{"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","y":0.13517441831840915,"w":0.19845856984456378,"h":0.014534884278879279,"c":1,"x":0.098265898026658416},{"c":1,"x":0.098265913581293579,"y":0.17138364790329796,"w":0.67822733561197923,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score:","h":0.017610062893081757},{"w":0.75915222167968754,"h":0.020487787738536212,"t":"Some people believe that it is best to accept a bad situation, such as an unsatistactory job or","x":0.098265893015849884,"c":1,"y":0.2005813949526517},{"h":0.020440251572326984,"w":0.69171483357747399,"c":1,"t":"shortage of money. Others argue that it is better to try and improve such situations.","y":0.22232704349128074,"x":0.098265897179347902},{"y":0.25145348860681738,"h":0.018986763144439145,"x":0.098265885278189649,"w":0.7996146647135417,"t":"Based on my knowledge, some people choose to accept the fate that they have to undergo the bad","c":1},{"x":0.098265908601053692,"h":0.020453050001612239,"c":1,"y":0.27169811317405945,"t":"situation as they believe that good things might come out of it. Their solution is simply to just go","w":0.79768783569335933},{"c":1,"h":0.01897396471515389,"x":0.098265893502197055,"y":0.29360465139707337,"t":"with the flow because they think that they will learn something new along the journey. For example,","w":0.80732177734374999},{"h":0.020442079747997721,"c":1,"y":0.31540697635042225,"w":0.79768783569335933,"x":0.098265908630822976,"t":"a student received a grade & for his Physics examination. However, he only needs one more mark"},{"h":0.020348837990430857,"w":0.81695566813151033,"t":"to get an A. If a student requires to receive a mark percentage of 70% to get an A, this student got","x":0.096339121723649154,"y":0.33575581355422801,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.35719255599043565,"t":"a 69% on his paper. As the teacher looked through the questions with the whole class, he notices","x":0.09820621236878746,"h":0.021806740910752076,"w":0.79202987670898439},{"h":0.022518527432807578,"x":0.098204001058795717,"c":1,"y":0.37862859529240778,"t":"that the teacher accidentally marked his correct answer to wrong. So, realistically, he should get an","w":0.81323603312174486},{"t":"A. However, he chooses to leave his grade as a B because he believes that his current grade will","w":0.79201726277669282,"y":0.39959478350636335,"x":0.098218983075289451,"c":1,"h":0.022114272687420167},{"x":0.098208880202152876,"h":0.022313735769979637,"t":"be a motivation for him to improve and work harder to get a better grade in the next examination.","y":0.42096188895821385,"w":0.80935368855794265,"c":1},{"t":"Hence, this explains why some people chooses to accept the bad situation...","w":0.61905629475911461,"h":0.029130842100899113,"y":0.43915585553362746,"c":1,"x":0.098003597782618496},{"x":0.098136005410300792,"y":0.46826407652407509,"w":0.73631551106770832,"h":0.026730140350149867,"c":1,"t":"Besides that, it is also mentioned that others argue that is better to try and improve such"},{"w":0.74566472371419279,"h":0.020474989309250957,"x":0.098265904867373785,"c":1,"y":0.49273255754548217,"t":"situations. I believe the reason they act that way is because they feel a bit paranoid that the"},{"c":1,"w":0.80539499918619795,"h":0.018917288270386523,"t":"situation will become worse if they do not do so. For instance, a person had to undergo a shortage","x":0.098265891452404427,"y":0.51598837232740513},{"y":0.53633720889993053,"t":"of money. Logically, they will feel a little paranoid that at one point, they might have to experience","h":0.020348837990430968,"c":1,"x":0.098265885180308502,"w":0.79961466471354159},{"w":0.81695566813151044,"h":0.020476817484921583,"c":1,"y":0.55813953448934595,"x":0.098265903798763932,"t":"an empty pocket and had to live in the streets. Regarding that matter, they figured out a solution to"},{"w":0.80346822102864579,"t":"improvise such situations by getting an extra or part-time job. This solution will help them to gain","c":1,"y":0.57987421400081507,"x":0.098265889392134986,"h":0.018962995061334587},{"y":0.6002906979047008,"w":0.78227361043294263,"t":"extra money to pay their daily expenses such as water and electricity bills. This means that their","h":0.018895348362952591,"c":1,"x":0.09826589214607083},{"c":1,"t":"problems are solved and they are now worry-free.","x":0.098265893284886233,"y":0.62201257836016832,"h":0.01897579349061973,"w":0.41425819396972652},{"t":"In my honest opinion, I strongly suggest that one can choose to act in both situations according to","y":0.65116279029592949,"w":0.77649327596028661,"c":1,"x":0.096339104014182247,"h":0.020348837990430968},{"w":0.80539499918619795,"y":0.67295597503394178,"x":0.098265891427257848,"h":0.018904489841101269,"c":1,"t":"situations. When facing a problem, think of the best solution to solve it. If the situation requires you to"},{"y":0.6946540880026002,"w":0.81695566813151055,"h":0.019008702452077753,"c":1,"t":"simply ignore it, then just do so. There is a no need in figuring out a way to improve those situations as","x":0.098265903720718958},{"w":0.80539499918619806,"c":1,"y":0.7165697676766789,"t":"it will take up your time and cause stress. However, if the situation requires you to take action quickly,","h":0.018964823237005213,"x":0.098265891445714626},{"w":0.76107899983723959,"h":0.020474989309250957,"c":1,"t":"by all means do so as you might not know what are the consequences if you ignore the problem.","x":0.098265894971028167,"y":0.73679245293905804},{"h":0.018917288270386523,"w":0.78227361043294263,"t":"In a conclusion, the main important thing when facing bad situations is to analyze the problem,","x":0.096339109925443631,"y":0.76598837232712347,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.098265901736104791,"t":"then only you can react to them. Not all bad situations needs to be ignored and not all needs to be","h":0.020348837990430968,"y":0.78633720890932135,"w":0.81502888997395828},{"y":0.8066037734084367,"c":1,"w":0.58959538777669274,"t":"improved. Think wisely to get the best solution for all of your problems.","x":0.096339107451799563,"h":0.020440251572326984},{"c":1,"x":0.098127172535978954,"w":0.3066620890299479,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.017965129636368649,"y":0.84311526145766158},{"c":1,"x":0.14439464044800426,"t":"The candidate has addressed all parts of the task and shows a clear position","w":0.70541834513346346,"y":0.88059171338574815,"h":0.019433825270934624},{"w":0.70920801798502608,"y":0.90031493843041788,"t":"throughout the response. Ideas are presented, extended and supported. The","c":1,"h":0.019239449650986451,"x":0.14248861509355049},{"x":0.14246963749831659,"y":0.91714276357561164,"c":1,"w":0.69581532796223966,"h":0.021853424168232771,"t":"response is logically organised and there is a clear progression throughout,"},{"c":1,"w":0.036608861287434888,"t":"128","x":0.098265897077862527,"y":0.95203488386006496,"h":0.014534883079288852}],"h":3179,"w":2400}